  "description": "Valloire is a real working mountain village in the Maurienne valley. Stone-built chalets, a pedestrianised centre, 17th-century Baroque church (Notre-Dame de l'Assomption with ornate gilded interior). Home to the highest brewery in France \u2014 Galibier beer brewed with glacier water. Linked with Valmeinier to form Galibier-Thabor (160km, 90 runs, 70% above 2,000m). 30 lifts including high-speed quads and 2 gondolas \u2014 short queues even in school holidays. Selles blue run (6.8km, 2,410m to 1,725m) is one of the longest in Savoie.",
